From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QinCai-rui <git@qincai.xyz>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm: sunxi: use the current client buffer cleanup API

Replace the removed framebuffer deletion helper with
drm_client_buffer_delete(). The replacement also unmaps the buffer,
so remove the separate unmap call.

---
diff --git a/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_fbdev_platform.c b/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_fbdev_platform.c
--- a/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_fbdev_platform.c
+++ b/bsp/drivers/drm/sunxi_fbdev_platform.c
@@ -297,9 +297,7 @@
 	if (!info || !info->buffer)
 		return 0;
 
-	drm_client_buffer_vunmap(info->buffer);
-
-	drm_client_framebuffer_delete(info->buffer);
+	drm_client_buffer_delete(info->buffer);
 	info->buffer = NULL;
 
 	info->state.base.fb = NULL;
